OL,3,GNEWSAWales scraps controversial Uganda
OL,4,Atree-planting scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government will end funding
OL,7,Ffor a tree-planting scheme in Uganda
OL,8,Fthat was branded "woke" by opposition
OL,9,Fpoliticians.
OL,11,FWales has given more than #4m to
OL,12,Fclimate change charity Size of Wales
OL,13,Fsince 2015, including #350,000 for the
OL,14,Fcurrent financial year, to work with
OL,15,FIndigenous communities to promote
OL,16,Ftree-planting in the African nation.
OL,18,FMinisters said budgetary pressures
OL,19,Fmeant "difficult decisions" had to be
OL,20,Fmade and the charity would lose its
OL,21,Fgrant for the scheme at the end of
OL,22,FMarch 2027.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
