OL,3,GNEWSAWales scraps controversial Uganda
OL,4,Atree-planting scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FRight-wing parties in the Senedd
OL,7,Fwelcomed the decision, and left-wing
OL,8,Fones criticised it, with the Welsh
OL,9,FLiberal Democrats accusing the Plaid
OL,10,FCymru-run government of "out-Reforming
OL,11,FReform".
